<title>ITALY: SOCCER-ITALIAN CUP FINAL SECOND LEG SUMMARY.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ITALIAN CUP FINAL SECOND LEG SUMMARY.</headline>
<dateline>VICENZA, Italy 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary of Italian Cup final second leg played on Thursday:</p>
<p> Vicenza    3 - Gianpiero Maini 20, Maurizio Rossi 117,</p>
<p>Alessandro Iannuzzi 120</p>
<p> Napoli     0</p>
<p>Red Card: Nicola Caccia (Napoli) 91</p>
<p>HT 1-0 Attendance: 20,000</p>
<p>Vicenza win 3-1 on aggregate.</p>
</text>
